comments.body:
believe that similar guard as used before to install btree gin extension before doing the specific upgrade would help the initial problem, so for example

       DO LANGUAGE 'plpgsql' $$
       BEGIN
           IF ( NOT EXISTS (select extname from pg_extension where extname = 'btree_gin') ) THEN
               CREATE EXTENSION btree_gin;
           END IF;
         END
      $$;
